---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-12 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-5xl resonance-glow text-center mb-8">About Atlas Island</h1>
    
    <!-- Founder Bio -->
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center space-y-5">
      <img 
        src="/z-atlas.jpg" 
        alt="Z Atlas Morphoenix" 
        class="w-48 h-48 rounded-full object-cover border-2 border-[var(--color-solar)] shadow-[0_0_25px_var(--color-solar)]"
      />
      <h2 class="text-4xl resonance-glow">Z Atlas Morphoenix</h2>
      <p class="text-sm tracking-widest uppercase opacity-80">they/she</p>
      <p class="text-lg max-w-xl leading-relaxed opacity-90 italic">
        Sacred guide, Reiki master, and ancestral channeler. Z Atlas holds space for healing across dimensions, weaving ancient wisdom with modern resonance to awaken the Heartlight in every being who arrives at our shores.
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Sanctuary Description -->
    <div class="prose prose-invert prose-gold text-lg leading-relaxed space-y-6">
      Atlas Island is a sanctuary of healing, awakening and remembrance, sacredly guided by Z Atlas Morphoenix. We offer Reiki, ancestral channeling, and multidimensional energy healing that harmonizes body, mind, and soul. Located in Charlotte, NC, we hold sacred space for your transformation integrating ancient wisdom, Ray frequencies, and intuitive guidance. Every session is a personalized journey to expand your Heartlight, awaken your innate gifts, and align you with the sacredness and interconnectedness of ALL that IS.
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
